# This directory is committed empty on purpose.
#
# Evidence artefacts (screenshots, environment captures, inspection records) land
# here from Increment 1 onward. `.gitignore` carries an explicit
# `!docs/evidence/**` exception so that a `.log` or `.png` committed here survives
# the general ignore rules.
#
# See README.md in this directory for naming, the caption-file requirement, and
# the register of the ten artefacts expected across the five increments.
